          },
          "docs": "Returns a configuration string in the following form: \n`configuration=parameterId%3DparameterValue` \nThe configuration string can be used in other Onshape API calls to specify which configuration option to use. See the [Configuration API Guide](https://onshape-public.github.io/docs/api-adv/configs/) for additional details. \n"
        },
